Subject: [PATCH] fix(commands): repair Bedrock command completion

Restore translated command suggestions from ViaBedrock PR #427 as an individually reviewable feature patch.

Translate chained Bedrock subcommands and postfix tokens into Java Brigadier nodes, preserving completion and dispatch for those paths.
